00:02:49.848 --> 00:02:52.632
<v Host>The new manager is Hideki Matsui.

00:02:53.231 --> 00:02:59.951
<v Slow>松井さんは52歳で、石川県の出身です。

00:03:00.752 --> 00:03:05.312
<v Host>Matsui is fifty-two and comes from Ishikawa Prefecture.

00:03:05.912 --> 00:03:08.216
